3. **Add visualization:**
   - Custom RViz plugins
   - Real-time path planning visualization

4. **Implement fleet coordination:**
   - Collision avoidance
   - Task allocation
   - Swarm behaviors

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────┐
│  Dashboard      │  (Your existing web interface)
│  (Browser)      │
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│  FastAPI        │  (Your existing API)
│  + Database     │
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│  ROS 2 Bridge   │  ◄──── New! Publishes to ROS topics
│  Node           │
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│  ROS 2          │
│  Topics/TF      │  ◄──── Other ROS nodes can subscribe
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│  Real Hardware  │  (Future: actual drones/robots)
│  Controllers    │
└─────────────────┘
```

